  "_rf_comment": "RF (coax/HFC) plant is not part of the FTTH BOM. rf_device_*: RF devices on the DES_* design layers (amplifiers, taps, splitters, terminators, end-of-line). A vault/L-box within rf_support_radius_ft of an RF device and with no fiber splice within rf_support_splice_ft is RF support and not counted. Aerial strand counts only with an aerial fiber cable within fiber_bearing_strand_ft. RF power supplies (DES_POWER) are not evidence: the coax-powered OLM sits beside one.",
